    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1507" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄδρυα</span></b> , τά, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρόδρυα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.83a
			</span></i>; Sicilian word, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
